---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, telLink, mailLink } from '../data/site';

const effective = '23 October 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy notice"
  description="How Nexvhira collects, uses and protects the personal data you share when you contact us."
>
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="prose">
        <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
        <p class="lede">Effective {effective}</p>

        <p>
          This notice explains what personal data {site.name} collects when you use this website or contact us, why we
          collect it, who else handles it, and the rights you have under India’s Digital Personal Data Protection Act,
          2023.
        </p>

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          {site.name} is a software company based in {site.city}, {site.region}, {site.country}. For this website and
          your enquiries, we decide how your personal data is used.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>From the enquiry form:</strong> your name, phone or WhatsApp number, and anything else you choose to
            give us, such as your email address, business name, the service you are interested in and your message.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>When you contact us directly:</strong> your phone number, WhatsApp name and number, or email
            address, and the messages you send us.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not ask for, and you should not send us, passwords, bank details or identity documents.</p>

        <h2>Why we use it</h2>
        <p>
          We use your data only to reply to your enquiry, discuss your project and prepare a quote. We do not sell
          your data or use it for advertising.
        </p>

        <h2>Your consent</h2>
        <p>
          We process your data because you agree to it when you send the form or contact us. You can withdraw your
          consent at any time by writing to us. After that we stop using your data, though this does not affect what
          we did before you withdrew.
        </p>

        <h2>Who else handles your data</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Web3Forms</strong> delivers enquiry-form messages to our email inbox.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts this website and may process your IP address to deliver pages and protect
            the site from attacks.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Meta (WhatsApp)</strong> and <strong>Google (Gmail)</strong> carry your messages when you contact us
            on WhatsApp or by email.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>Each of these services handles data under its own privacy policy.</p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          If your enquiry does not become a project, we delete your details within 12 months. If you become a client,
          we keep what we need for the project and for our records for as long as the law requires.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not set cookies and does not use advertising trackers. We may use Cloudflare Web
          Analytics, which counts visits without cookies and without identifying you.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>You can ask us to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>tell you what personal data we hold about you and how we use it;</li>
          <li>correct, complete or update it;</li>
          <li>erase it, unless we must keep it by law;</li>
          <li>stop using it, by withdrawing your consent;</li>
          <li>
            act on your behalf through a person you nominate, if you die or become unable to exercise these rights.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Questions and complaints</h2>
        <p>
          Contact {site.founder.name}, {site.founder.role}, at <a href={mailLink}>{site.email}</a> or
          <a href={telLink}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>. We aim to reply within 7 days.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you are not satisfied with our reply, you can complain to the Data Protection Board of India.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this notice</h2>
        <p>
          If we change how we handle your data, we will update this page and the effective date at the top.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose .lede {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }
  .prose h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
  }
</style>
